# Outgoing ShareBizz mail

Follow `dotnet/docs/EMAIL-ADDRESSES.md` when adding or changing a sent email.

- OTP, verification, password reset, security alerts, welcome credentials, payment confirmation, invoice notice, activation, and renewal reminders: From `noreply@sharebizz.com`. Set Reply-To to `support@sharebizz.com`, or `billing@sharebizz.com` when the message is about payment or an invoice.
- Support replies: `support@sharebizz.com`.
- Partnerships, franchise enquiries, and acquisition campaigns: `business@sharebizz.com`. Include an unsubscribe path on campaigns.
- Invoices, payments, and refunds: `billing@sharebizz.com`.
- Job applications: `careers@sharebizz.com`, and send an auto-reply.
- Employee HR mail: `hr@sharebizz.com`.
- Do not send promotional campaigns from `noreply`. Do not add `sales@`, `partners@`, `franchise@`, or `investor@`.
